{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GridFiller Think. Rotate. Fill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant world of GridFiller, a minimalist yet deeply satisfying block puzzle game that will challenge your spatial reasoning and logic skills. Your mission is simple: fill every square on the grid. But with obstacles in your way and uniquely shaped blocks to maneuver, each level becomes a thrilling test of strategy and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481670/extras/5ae36843b1f0b45fc767f4736b5a1ed2.poster.avif?t=1739892747\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481670/extras/5ae36843b1f0b45fc767f4736b5a1ed2.webm?t=1739892747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481670/extras/5ae36843b1f0b45fc767f4736b5a1ed2.mp4?t=1739892747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 200+ Unique Levels: A massive collection of handcrafted puzzles, from beginner-friendly to brain-bending challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful Aesthetics: Clean, modern design with soothing colors to keep you immersed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Dynamic Mechanics: Rotate, move, and fit blocks with precision as you solve each grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing Soundtrack: Chill to a lo-fi soundtrack while you focus on the task at hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img